# Conformance probe pack for `swap` under `bit_order msb-lsb` (spec 0.22,
# ruling 13). Public. No kinds. Bit order msb-lsb (spec 0.22): positions count from the
# high bit of each byte, a value is assembled from its first bit up.
#
#   bytes 0..1    x      16 bits, the two bytes taken in reverse order
format     conformance-long-mlsb-swap
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
word_bytes 1
bit_order  msb-lsb
field   probe.x  0:0:16  uint  swap
